    "Old OOM/UTF8 assertions, ref race and bounded callback-deadlock controls reproduce fixed defects; the separate mutation/match race remains an open publication-policy boundary.",
    "Native public headers and upstream XRT implementation are unchanged; no new C-to-language forwarding layer is introduced."
